  {
    "name": "a global Send Event reaches every enabled Receive Event on its channel, the payload landing before Received; a disabled receiver and one on another channel hear nothing; a sender with no channel name fails and says so",
    "clauses": [
      "N",
      "S2"
    ],
    "because": "eventsender.ts `sendEvent`: \"Sends one event on Channel Name, after every payload input has settled\"; `channelName`: \"Name every Receive Event must match to hear this\"; eventreceiver.ts `eventReceived`: \"Fires when an event arrives on Channel, once the payload outputs carry that event's values\" (NDA-012: the payload lands before Received \u2014 the sink behind the payload port reads the new value in the frame Received fires); `enabled`: \"while off they are ignored\"; eventsender.ts `error`: 'No channel name, so the event was not sent'",
